Subject: [PATCH net-next 4/4] net: stmmac: Defer VLAN HW configuration when interface is down
Date: Mon, 23 Feb 2026 12:41:02 +0000
Message-ID: <20260223124102.120432-5-ovidiu.panait.rb@renesas.com>
